            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.38.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ita 38:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ igihe gihise, hageze mw igenya ry’ingano, Samusoni asubira iy’ umugore ari, ajanye agasuguru k’impene. Aravuga, ati Hinge nje iy’ umugore wanje ari, haruguru; ariko sebukwe ntiyamukundira kujayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.14.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Abac 14:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aramubgira, at’ Erega nagira ngo waramwanse rwose; ni co catumye ndamuha umwe muri bagenzi bawe. Mbega murumuna we si we anamurusha ubgiza? Enda mujane mu gishingo ciwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samusoni arababgira, at’ Ubu ho nta kizombako ku vy’Abafilisitiya, ni naramuka ndabagiriye nabi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Samusoni aragenda afata imbgebge amajana atatu, ahambira ivyatsi vyo gukongerezak’ umuriro; araheza izo mbgebge azitumberanya imirizo, agenda abohera ivyo vyatsi ku mirizo ibiri‐ibiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amaze kudomeka ivyo vyatsi, azirekurira mu mirima y’ingano z’Abafilisitiya; uwo muriro ugenda uratōngōra kuva ku mikama itēkeye no ku ngano zigihagaze gushitsa no ku mirima y’imyelayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.14.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Abac 14:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ Abafilisitiya barabaza, bati Ni nde yakoze ivyo? Bati Ni Samusoni, umukwe wa wa Munyatimuna, kuko yamwātse umugore wiwe akamushingira uwundi. Nukw Abafilisitiya baca baradūga, uwo mugore bamuturirana na se. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Samusoni arababarira, ati Ko mukoze murtyo, sinzogenda ntabīhōye! Ariko ni naheza kubīhōra nzorekeraho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aca arabahindikiranya, arabatikiza bikomeye; araheza aramanuka, aja kuba mu gihoro co mu gitandara c’ahitwa Etamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ Abafilisitiya baradūga, basagaza mu Buyuda, baragandagaza, barinda bashika i Lehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ab’i Buyuda barababaza, bati N’iki kibazanye kudutera? Barabishura, bati Tuzanywe no gufata Samusoni ngo tumubohe, tumugirire nk’ivyo yatugiriye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.14.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Abac 14:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ abantu b’i Buyuda ibihumbi bitatu baca baramanuka, basanga Samusoni muri ca gihoro co mu gitandara c’ahitwa Etamu; baramubaza, bati Mbega ntuzi yukw Abafilisitiya ari bo batuganza? Non’ ivyo udukoreye n’ibiki? Arabishura, at’ Erega kwar’ ukubasubiriza mu nkōko ivyo bāngiriye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baramwishura, bat’ Ikituzanye n’ukugufata ngo tukubohe, tugutange mu maboko y’ Abafilisitiya. Samusoni arabishura, ati Ni mundahire ko mutanyica mwebge ubganyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.16.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Abac 16:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.16.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baramwishura, bat’ Oya, turakuboha gusa, tubagushikirize, ariko twebge ubgacu ntitukwica. Nuko bamubohesha imigozi misha ibiri, bamukūra mur’ ico gitandara baramudūgana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
